        "id": 2039159
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T19:29:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not an issue if we try to perform decryption with different keys which is why we iterate through all the possible keys until decryption is successful. Do you want the function to individually decrypt AD types one by one? If so, why would that be preferred?",
      "parentUuid": "18c1eb72_5b912423",
      "revId": "329a4f1b78f61a63a5a30ea439c7b6bded859346",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0748abf5_89919d74",
        "filename": "system/gd/hci/le_scanning_decrypter.cc",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 40,
      "author": {
        "id": 1884477
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T21:04:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Do you want the function to individually decrypt AD types one by one? If so, why \u003e would that be preferred?\n\nThe code would gain in readability by separating the handling logic (decrypting data) from the control flow (iterating over ad_types).\nThis is why I am proposing the code structure above; it makes the code structure immediately visible.",
      "parentUuid": "378b7e2d_3ea1f777",
      "revId": "329a4f1b78f61a63a5a30ea439c7b6bded859346",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d8558d3a_e8f9c533",
        "filename": "system/gd/hci/le_scanning_decrypter.cc",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 40,
      "author": {
        "id": 2039159
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-05T21:21:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not possible to decrypt each AD type individually since the entire LTV value of the AD types are encrypted. There is no way to split the Encrypted Data into individual encrypted AD types. The packet looks like this\n(Length of Encrypted Data) + (Encrypted Data Type Value) + (Encrypted Data)\n\nEncrypted Data is composed of (LTV + LTV + LTV ...)",
      "parentUuid": "0748abf5_89919d74",
      "revId": "329a4f1b78f61a63a5a30ea439c7b6bded859346",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
